  never enabled -> Mali rejected the modules, RADV accepted).
- gemm_int8.comp: rename non-local-memory gx4/gy4 scalars (collided
  with main-scope ivec4s when NCNN_shader_local_memory is off, i.e.
  all integrated GPUs).

